{"id":1555,"title":"排序算法介绍","summary":"排序导言","tags":"","components":[{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"497bad57-c1f0-385c-8718-9e2b0f5aa1e1","knowledge_id":324,"title":"排序导言","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":0,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":324,"title":"排序导言","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"7344725c-2aa7-3c8c-ab29-90bb744692f3","title":"","title_html":"","text":"**排序**是按特定顺序排列元素的过程，最常见的是升序或降序。\n\n排序是计算机编程中最常见的任务之一，可用于:\n\n- **数据分析**： 用于组织和分析大型数据集。\n- **用户界面**： 按系统顺序显示项目，如按名称、日期或大小对文件进行排序。\n- **数据库系统**：对记录进行排序并执行更快的搜索操作。\n- **算法设计**：某些算法依赖于对输入数据进行排序。","text_html":"<p><strong>排序</strong>是按特定顺序排列元素的过程，最常见的是升序或降序。</p>\n<p>排序是计算机编程中最常见的任务之一，可用于:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>数据分析</strong>： 用于组织和分析大型数据集。</li>\n<li><strong>用户界面</strong>： 按系统顺序显示项目，如按名称、日期或大小对文件进行排序。</li>\n<li><strong>数据库系统</strong>：对记录进行排序并执行更快的搜索操作。</li>\n<li><strong>算法设计</strong>：某些算法依赖于对输入数据进行排序。</li>\n</ul>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0}]}},{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"84a7022e-ca0c-3b69-96d7-00a7e0285bb8","knowledge_id":325,"title":"如何对数据进行排序？","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":1,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":325,"title":"如何对数据进行排序？","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"d79da69c-c40a-3db8-8159-5a17920442f3","title":"","title_html":"","text":"假设有一个数字列表，如下所示：","text_html":"<p>假设有一个数字列表，如下所示：</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"ae2e65ea-b98a-34cd-b331-d0c4dde0bb9c","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"numbers = [12, -4, 56, 67, 10]","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":false,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"140cc5f7-ecb5-357f-b350-5902f98ee305","title":"","title_html":"","text":"你可以使用列表的 `sort()` 方法轻松地对这些元素进行升序排序。","text_html":"<p>你可以使用列表的 <code>sort()</code> 方法轻松地对这些元素进行升序排序。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":2},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"bc5d8f08-9252-3c6b-b86b-6b7e0cd06e1b","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"numbers = [12, -4, 56, 67, 10]\nnumbers.sort()  # [-4, 10, 12, 56, 67]\n\nprint(numbers)","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":3},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"11827b98-d2c2-37bc-be8f-644317d2ab67","title":"","title_html":"","text":"在后台，`sort()`方法使用了**Timsort**，这是一种混合排序算法，源自**合并排序**和**插入排序**。\n\n> 后续课程将详细介绍合并排序、插入排序。","text_html":"<p>在后台，<code>sort()</code>方法使用了<strong>Timsort</strong>，这是一种混合排序算法，源自<strong>合并排序</strong>和<strong>插入排序</strong>。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>后续课程将详细介绍合并排序、插入排序。</p>\n</blockquote>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":4}]}},{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"f6343f6f-e3c6-3c4b-a7d1-5677ee60f9f5","knowledge_id":326,"title":"不同的排序算法","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":2,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":326,"title":"不同的排序算法","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"7f2f90eb-e3ce-34c9-906e-fcbd35da8113","title":"","title_html":"","text":"在本章中，我们不会使用 `sort()`方法对元素进行排序。相反，我们将学习不同排序算法的内部**工作原理**。\n\n每种算法都能提供不同程度的效率，具体取决于数据集及其使用情况。\n\n本章将介绍以下排序算法：\n\n- 冒泡排序\n- 选择排序\n- 插入排序\n- 合并排序\n- 快速排序\n- 计数排序\n\n上述列表中的前三种排序(冒泡、选择、插入)都是**基于比较**的排序。\n基于比较的排序算法通过比较两个元素并在必要时交换它们来工作。\n\n接下来，我们将学习第一种排序算法--**冒泡排序**。","text_html":"<p>在本章中，我们不会使用 <code>sort()</code>方法对元素进行排序。相反，我们将学习不同排序算法的内部<strong>工作原理</strong>。</p>\n<p>每种算法都能提供不同程度的效率，具体取决于数据集及其使用情况。</p>\n<p>本章将介绍以下排序算法：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>冒泡排序</li>\n<li>选择排序</li>\n<li>插入排序</li>\n<li>合并排序</li>\n<li>快速排序</li>\n<li>计数排序</li>\n</ul>\n<p>上述列表中的前三种排序(冒泡、选择、插入)都是<strong>基于比较</strong>的排序。\n基于比较的排序算法通过比较两个元素并在必要时交换它们来工作。</p>\n<p>接下来，我们将学习第一种排序算法--<strong>冒泡排序</strong>。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0}]}}],"status":"undo","course_no":"035","source_url":"https://edu.py2fun.com/api/course/035/page/1555"}
